<% title = "Welcome to Gym and Soccer"; %>
<% content = `
<h2>Welcome to Gym and Soccer</h2>
<p>Welcome to the place where fitness and soccer come together. Whether you want to build muscle, improve your soccer skills, or get better at both, this website has everything you need. We provide easy-to-follow advice and tips to help you get stronger, faster, and better at the game.</p> <p>In the gym, you will find simple workouts that can help you build strength, flexibility, and stamina. Whether you're new to exercise or have been training for a while, we have routines that suit your level. We also give you tips on how to stay motivated and work out safely.</p> <p>For soccer, we cover basic drills to help you improve your passing, shooting, and ball control. These drills are designed to help players of all levels get better at their game. We also talk about how to think like a soccer player and improve your decision-making on the field.</p> <p>Good nutrition and recovery are important parts of getting better in the gym and on the field. We give advice on what to eat to keep your energy up and your muscles strong. Plus, we explain how to recover after a workout or game, so you stay injury-free and keep improving.</p>


